{"author":{"id":"127a58c7f014820991be95805df42525db12c92e2d7319d04d4df105a9aa3444"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1788112102,"nonce":"XH33pqIuhP8QUNcPfjtixiFZY9g=","title":"3.1 Dev-layer verbs (dev:*)","message":"Wave 3 — hands. Depends: 1.1, 1.2 (journaling). The god-hand.\n\n## Goal\n`dev:*` verbs — fixture setup and demo staging. Cheap on purpose: the game's\nDebugActions already implement almost all of this; wrap, don't reinvent.\n\n## Context (read first)\n- DESIGN.md §Action model (dev layer is journaled-as-cheat, always)\n- decompiled: DebugActionsMisc, DebugActionsSpawn?, DebugThingPlaceHelper,\n  IncidentDef/IncidentWorker.TryExecute + IncidentParms, WeatherDef,\n  ResearchManager.FinishProject, HealthUtility\n\n## Scope\ndev:spawn-thing (def, stuff?, count, pos|stockpile), dev:spawn-pawn (kind,\nfaction, pos), dev:heal (pawn, full|injuries), dev:set-need (pawn, need, val),\ndev:add-hediff / dev:remove-hediff, dev:set-skill (pawn, skill, level,\npassion?), dev:finish-research (project|all), dev:incident (def, points?,\nfaction?, extra parms as available), dev:weather (def), dev:destroy (thing),\ndev:starter-kit (macro: config-driven bundle — food, meds, materials, weapons\n— one call to stage a fixture).\n\n## Invariants\nEvery dev verb writes a `dev` journal event (verb, args, tick) — fixture\nprovenance is not optional. Position args resolve via 2.3 conventions\n(landmarks etc.) when 2.3 exists; raw x,z until then.\n\n## Open questions (worker's)\nExact v1 verb list (mine the DebugActions catalog; propose additions on the\nissue); incident parms surface (raid strategy/arrival mode — expose what\nIncidentParms supports cleanly); starter-kit config format.\n\n## Acceptance\nScripted fixture: 3 colonists spawned with set skills, starter kit, shelter\nmaterials, then dev:incident raid — runs green end-to-end; journal carries\ncomplete dev provenance; spawned things visible to 2.x serializers.","files":null}]}